# YTScrollingKiller

Before changing code, read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the repo map and do/don’t list.

## Conventions

- Flutter app; English UI only.
- Single-short playback via YouTube IFrame embed — do not introduce a Shorts feed.
- Intercept browsers only (Android Accessibility / iOS Safari extension). No YouTube-app intercept. No MITM VPN.
- Deep link scheme: `ytsk://short/{videoId}`.
- Keep `lib/README.md`, `android/README.md`, and `ios/README.md` accurate when moving native or Dart entry points.
